      "role": "user",
      "content": "looks good so far. can u finish the rest of the days? specifically need to know the transition from bangkok to ho chi minh city and what the schedule should look like for the final two days there. also, maybe add some specific suggestions for business-friendly dinner spots in each city so i can pass them along.",
